Net::Tools
==============

Net::Tools provides socket I/O functions, length-prefixed and serialized
messages, and non-blocking messages over socket pairs. Split from Data::Tools
in 1.60 (Data::Tools::Socket* became Net::Tools::Socket*).

INSTALLATION

To install this module type the following:

   perl Makefile.PL
   make
   make test
   make install

DEPENDENCIES

Net::Tools requires Data::Tools.

